#. Global message key: aboutBody1
#: src/data/i18n.js:1
msgctxt "text:aboutBody1"
msgid ""
"Our campus links the Human Village, Youkai Mountain, Misty Lake, and the "
"Bamboo Forest. Students with different lifespans and abilities study "
"together here."
msgstr "校園連接人間之里、妖怪之山、霧之湖與迷途竹林。壽命與能力各異的學生，在這裡一起上課。"

#. Global message key: aboutBody2
#: src/data/i18n.js:1
msgctxt "text:aboutBody2"
msgid ""
"We study incidents, local history, medicine, magic, and the things that keep "
"Gensokyo running."
msgstr "我們研究異變、地方歷史、醫學、魔法，以及支撐幻想鄉日常的技術。"

