msgctxt "text:faqAnswerNoAbility"
msgid ""
"Yes. Choose a question, describe how you would study it, and tell us how you "
"work with others. You may use a special ability as part of your method."
msgstr "可以。提出問題、說明研究方法，並告訴我們你如何與人合作。特殊能力也可作為研究方法的一部分。"

