#: src/data/i18n.js:1
msgctxt "text:faqAnswerBarrier"
msgid ""
"After admission, the office assigns a Hakurei Gate crossing time. Use the "
"designated entrance and register any Outside World electronics in advance."
msgstr "錄取後，招生處會安排博麗門的通行時段。請使用指定入口，並預先登記外界電子設備。"

